{"id":13065,"date":"2026-03-03T13:03:57","date_gmt":"2026-03-03T13:03:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=13065"},"modified":"2026-03-03T13:03:57","modified_gmt":"2026-03-03T13:03:57","slug":"presne-monitorovani-procesu-bez-zbytecne-slozitosti","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/presne-monitorovani-procesu-bez-zbytecne-slozitosti\/","title":{"rendered":"P\u0159esn\u00e9 monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed proces\u016f bez zbyte\u010dn\u00e9 slo\u017eitosti"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"456\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"234\">MarqMetrix All-In-One Process Raman Analyzer<\/strong><\/a> je kompaktn\u00ed syst\u00e9m pro in-line Ramanovu spektroskopii ur\u010den\u00fd k nep\u0159etr\u017eit\u00e9mu sledov\u00e1n\u00ed chemick\u00fdch proces\u016f v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase. Poskytuje okam\u017eit\u00e1 data p\u0159\u00edmo z v\u00fdrobn\u00ed linky \u2013 bez nutnosti odb\u011bru vzork\u016f a laboratorn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edpravy.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"716\">Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed je navr\u017eeno pro provoz v n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00fdch pr\u016fmyslov\u00fdch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch a snadno se integruje do st\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00edch technologick\u00fdch celk\u016f. Umo\u017e\u0148uje rychl\u00e9 nasazen\u00ed, minimalizuje prodlevy mezi m\u011b\u0159en\u00edm a vyhodnocen\u00edm a podporuje rozhodov\u00e1n\u00ed zalo\u017een\u00e9 na aktu\u00e1ln\u00edch datech.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"745\">Typick\u00e9 oblasti pou\u017eit\u00ed<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"778\">Farmacie a biotechnologie<\/strong> \u2013 sledov\u00e1n\u00ed koncentrac\u00ed, reak\u010dn\u00ed kinetiky, kontrola kvality v pr\u016fb\u011bhu v\u00fdroby<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"935\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"890\">Polymern\u00ed v\u00fdroba a extruze<\/strong> \u2013 kontrola slo\u017een\u00ed a konzistence materi\u00e1lu<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1015\"><strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"963\">Bateriov\u00e9 technologie<\/strong> \u2013 monitoring chemick\u00fdch proces\u016f p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b \u010dl\u00e1nk\u016f<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1101\"><strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1033\">Ropa a plyn<\/strong> \u2013 anal\u00fdza procesn\u00edch proud\u016f v\u010detn\u011b prost\u0159ed\u00ed s nebezpe\u010d\u00edm v\u00fdbuchu<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1121\">Hlavn\u00ed p\u0159\u00ednosy<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1194\"><strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1158\">In-line m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase<\/strong> \u2013 bez zdr\u017een\u00ed a bez odb\u011bru vzork\u016f<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1231\">Kompaktn\u00ed a p\u0159enosn\u00e9 proveden\u00ed<\/strong> \u2013 jednoduch\u00e1 instalace a integrace<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1323\">Certifikace pro provoz v nebezpe\u010dn\u00fdch prostor\u00e1ch<\/strong> \u2013 vhodn\u00e9 i pro prost\u0159ed\u00ed s vy\u0161\u0161\u00edmi bezpe\u010dnostn\u00edmi n\u00e1roky<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1516\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong>MarqMetrix All-In-One<\/strong><\/a> je \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed pro t\u00fdmy, kter\u00e9 pot\u0159ebuj\u00ed spolehliv\u00e1 procesn\u00ed data p\u0159\u00edmo z v\u00fdroby \u2013 rychle, p\u0159esn\u011b a bez kompromis\u016f. V\u00edce se o tomto p\u0159\u00edstroji m\u016f\u017eete dozv\u011bd\u011bt <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=gTw7DoTVMBk\">v tomto videu<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>MarqMetrix All-In-One Process Raman Analyzer je kom